    <name>
      <text>Analise de codigo: mascara AND</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Compile e analise</strong> o programa abaixo. Depois responda aos campos.</p>

<div style="border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:6px;padding:6px 10px;overflow:auto;"><div class="highlight" style="background: #f0f0f0"><pre style="line-height: 125%;"><span></span><span style="color: #007020">#include</span><span style="color: #BBB"> </span><span style="color: #60A0B0; font-style: italic">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span>
<span style="color: #007020">#include</span><span style="color: #BBB"> </span><span style="color: #60A0B0; font-style: italic">&lt;stdint.h&gt;</span>

<span style="color: #902000">int</span><span style="color: #BBB"> </span><span style="color: #06287E">main</span>(<span style="color: #902000">void</span>)<span style="color: #BBB"> </span>{
<span style="color: #BBB">    </span><span style="color: #902000">uint8_t</span><span style="color: #BBB"> </span>reg<span style="color: #BBB">  </span><span style="color: #666">=</span><span style="color: #BBB"> </span><span style="color: #40A070">0b10110010</span>;
<span style="color: #BBB">    </span><span style="color: #902000">uint8_t</span><span style="color: #BBB"> </span>mask<span style="color: #BBB"> </span><span style="color: #666">=</span><span style="color: #BBB"> </span><span style="color: #40A070">0b00001111</span>;<span style="color: #BBB">   </span><span style="color: #60A0B0; font-style: italic">// isola os 4 bits baixos</span>
<span style="color: #BBB">    </span>printf(<span style="color: #4070A0">"%d</span><span style="color: #4070A0; font-weight: bold">\n</span><span style="color: #4070A0">"</span>,<span style="color: #BBB"> </span>reg<span style="color: #BBB"> </span><span style="color: #666">&amp;</span><span style="color: #BBB"> </span>mask);
<span style="color: #BBB">    </span><span style="color: #007020; font-weight: bold">return</span><span style="color: #BBB"> </span><span style="color: #40A070">0</span>;
}
</pre></div>
</div>

<p><strong>1) Qual e a saida impressa no terminal?</strong><br>
{1:SHORTANSWER:=2~%50%2 ~*#Lembre: <code>reg &amp; mask</code> isola os 4 bits baixos de <code>reg</code>.}</p>

<p><strong>2) (Enquete) O operador <code>&amp;</code> com a mascara <code>0b00001111</code> serve para:</strong><br>
{1:MULTICHOICE:=isolar os 4 bits baixos (mascara)#Correto!~ligar os 4 bits altos#Isso seria um OR com 0b11110000.~inverter todos os bits#Isso seria XOR com 0b11111111.}</p>

<p><strong>3) (V/F) Trocar <code>&amp;</code> por <code>&amp;&amp;</code> mudaria o resultado para 1.</strong><br>
{1:MULTICHOICE:=Verdadeiro#&amp;&amp; e logico: (178 != 0) &amp;&amp; (15 != 0) = 1~Falso#Reveja a diferenca entre & (bit a bit) e && (logico).}</p>
]]></text>
